ncidentally matched the sword value)\n- **Mass Change**: 39 → 32 (Δ -7, ~18% reduction)\n- **Tests**: All 5 tests stay green ✅\n\n**Naming**: All names already reveal intent (`processScenario`, `BASE_PREMIUM`, `PROCESSING_FEE`) — kept as-is.\n\n**Benefits**:\n- Cleaner code with fewer elements (Rule 4)\n- No dead code or unnecessary type noise\n- Still minimal — no premature generalization"}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_03-37-05_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_deepseek-v4-pro-no-thinking/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 5\nRecent Green phase: Added staff and potion to BASE_PREMIUM data table (data-only changes)\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 5\nRecent Green phase: Added staff and potion to BASE_PREMIUM data table (data-only changes)\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784950757405},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'll start by reading both files to understand the current state of"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9ba64de4903544a995266730","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.spec.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cf7f5db6591543648f5830e8","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":205,"output":98,"cacheRead":6144,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":6447,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784950757424,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-1d76c16e-5c4e-4c01-9bb5-7ebf1e2c56d2","responseModel":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9ba64de4903544a995266730","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\nimport { processScenario } from \"./claim-office.js\";\n\ndescribe(\"Claim Office - quote operation\", () => {\n  // --- Edge cases ---\n  it(\"should return premium of 5 G for empty item list (only processing fee)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [] }],\n    });\n    expect(result.results).toEqual([{ premium: 5 }]);\n  });\n\n  // --- Base premiums for individual items ---\n  it(\"should return premium for a plain sword -- 100 G base + 5 G fee = 105 G (no modifiers)\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"sword\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result.results).toEqual([{ premium: 105 }]);\n  });\n  it(\"should return premium for a plain amulet -- 60 G base + 5 G fee = 65 G\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"amulet\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result.results).toEqual([{ premium: 65 }]);\n  });\n  it(\"should return premium for a plain staff -- 80 G base + 5 G fee = 85 G\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"staff\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result.results).toEqual([{ premium: 85 }]);\n  });\n  it(\"should return premium for a plain potion -- 40 G base + 5 G fee = 45 G\", () => {\n    const result = processScenario({\n      customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: 0 },\n      steps: [{ op: \"quote\", items: [{ type: \"potion\" }] }],\n    });\n    expect(result.results).toEqual([{ premium: 45 }]);\n  });\n\n  // --- Components ---\n  it.todo(\"should return premium for a single rune -- 25 G base + 5 G fee = 30 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should return premium for 2 runes -- no block, 50 G base + 5 G fee = 55 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should return premium for 3 runes -- block applies, 60 G base + 5 G fee = 65 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should return premium for 4 runes -- no block (only exactly 3), 100 G base + 5 G fee = 105 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should return premium for 7 runes -- no block, 175 G base + 5 G fee = 180 G\");\n\n  // --- Mixed components ---\n  it.todo(\"should return premium for 2 runes + 1 moonstone -- no block (different types), 75 G base + 5 G fee = 80 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should return premium for 3 runes + 3 moonstones -- two separate blocks, 2x60 = 120 G base + 5 G fee = 125 G\");\n\n  // --- Premium modifiers: cursed ---\n  it.todo(\"should add 50% risk surcharge for a cursed sword -- 100 G base + 50 G curse + 5 G fee = 155 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should add 50% risk surcharge for a cursed amulet -- 60 G base + 30 G curse + 5 G fee = 95 G\");\n\n  // --- Premium modifiers: high enchantment ---\n  it.todo(\"should add 30% surcharge for a sword with enchantment 5 -- 100 G base + 30 G high enchantment + 5 G fee = 135 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should add 30% surcharge for a sword with enchantment 7 -- 100 G base + 30 G high enchantment + 5 G fee = 135 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should NOT add high-enchantment surcharge for a sword with enchantment 4 -- 100 G base + 5 G fee = 105 G\");\n\n  // --- Premium modifiers: both cursed and high enchantment ---\n  it.todo(\"should apply both cursed and high-enchantment surcharges to a cursed sword with enchantment 5 -- 100 G + 50 G + 30 G + 5 G = 185 G\");\n\n  // --- Premium modifiers: loyalty discount (>= 2 years) ---\n  it.todo(\"should apply 20% loyalty discount for customer with 2 years -- sword: 100 G base - 20 G loyalty + 5 G fee = 85 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should apply 20% loyalty discount for customer with 5 years -- sword: 100 G base - 20 G loyalty + 5 G fee = 85 G\");\n\n  // --- Premium modifiers: first-insurance surcharge ---\n  it.todo(\"should add 10% first-insurance surcharge -- sword: 100 G base + 10 G first insurance + 5 G fee = 115 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should apply first-insurance surcharge even to long-standing customers -- per item, not per customer\");\n\n  // --- Premium modifiers: follow-up contract discount ---\n  it.todo(\"should apply 15% discount on contract after the first -- second quote for same customer with sword: 100 G base + 10 G first insurance - 15 G follow-up + 5 G fee = 100 G\");\n\n  // --- Modifier scope: item-specific vs policy-wide ---\n  it.todo(\"should apply curse surcharge only to the cursed item's base premium, not to the whole policy -- cursed sword (100 G) + plain amulet (60 G) -> 160 G base + 50 G curse (on sword only) + 5 G fee = 215 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should apply high-enchantment surcharge only to the affected item, not to the whole policy\");\n\n  // --- Integration examples from spec ---\n  it.todo(\"should compute newcomer with cursed sword -- 0 years, first contract, cursed sword: 165 G (100+50+10=160, +5 fee=165)\");\n  it.todo(\"should compute long-standing customer's second contract -- 3 years, second quote, cursed sword enchantment 7: 160 G (100+50+30-20+10-15=155, +5 fee=160)\");\n\n  // --- Policy modifier precedence and rounding ---\n  it.todo(\"should round premium up in MHPCO's favor -- 197.5 G rounds to 198 G\");\n\n  // --- Unknown item type error ---\n  it.todo(\"should exit with non-zero code and write error to stderr for unknown item type in quote\");\n\n  // --- Multiple items of same type ---\n  it.todo(\"should correctly compute premium for two swords -- each sword treated individually for insurance sum and base premium\");\n\n  // --- Cap ---\n  it.todo(\"should set cap to 2x insurance sum: plain sword (ins sum 1000) -> cap 2000\");\n  it.todo(\"should use unmodified insurance value for cap (curse/modifiers do not raise cap)\");\n  it.todo(\"should account for multiple items in insurance sum: sword + 3 runes block -> 1000+750=1750 sum, cap 3500\");\n});\n\nd