: 165 G (100+50+10=160, +5 fee=165)\");\n  it.todo(\"should compute long-standing customer's second contract -- 3 years, second quote, cursed sword enchantment 7: 160 G (100+50+30-20+10-15=155, +5 fee=160)\");\n\n  // --- Policy modifier precedence and rounding ---\n  it.todo(\"should round premium up in MHPCO's favor -- 197.5 G rounds to 198 G\");\n\n  // --- Unknown item type error ---\n  it.todo(\"should exit with non-zero code and write error to stderr for unknown item type in quote\");\n\n  // --- Multiple items of same type ---\n  it.todo(\"should correctly compute premium for two swords -- each sword treated individually for insurance sum and base premium\");\n\n  // --- Cap ---\n  it.todo(\"should set cap to 2x insurance sum: plain sword (ins sum 1000) -> cap 2000\");\n  it.todo(\"should use unmodified insurance value for cap (curse/modifiers do not raise cap)\");\n  it.todo(\"should account for multiple items in insurance sum: sword + 3 runes block -> 1000+750=1750 sum, cap 3500\");\n});\n\ndescribe(\"claim-office - claim operation\", () => {\n  // --- Basic reimbursement ---\n  it.todo(\"should reimburse full damage minus deductible for regular sword -- damage 500 G -> payout 400 G (500-100)\");\n  it.todo(\"should reimburse damage to a rune minus deductible -- damage 200 G -> payout 100 G (200-100)\");\n  it.todo(\"should not apply special clause for rune (no enchantment level or material)\");\n\n  // --- Deductible per damage event ---\n  it.todo(\"should apply 100 G deductible per damaged item -- dragon damages sword (500 G) and amulet (300 G): payout 600 G\");\n\n  // --- Dragon material clause ---\n  it.todo(\"should fully reimburse (minus deductible) for dragon-material sword -- dragon sword enchantment 5, damage 800 G -> payout 700 G (800-100)\");\n\n  // --- High enchantment clause (>= 8) for damage ---\n  it.todo(\"should reimburse at 50% then deductible for high enchantment >= 8 -- steel sword enchantment 9, damage 1000 G -> payout 400 G (500-100